1.What is power query and why we use it and why important?
  Power query is a data cleaning tool ,it helps to make the cleaning process of uncleaned data
  ->we can make changes like removing duplicates,nulls and errors , changing datatypes,merge columns,append rows
  ->Without power query process, we cann't analyse data and create exact interactive reports and dashboards

2.What we can do in power query
  Change datatypes
  Remove duplicates
  Filter rows
  Rename columns
  Merge columns
  Append rows

3.what are the applied steps in power query
  Every action performed in power query, it stored under Applied steps
  Ex: Source,Changed type,Removed columns,Filtered rows
  These steps are automatically repeated whenever data is refreshed

4.power query workflow
  Get data -> power query -> clean & transform data -> load data -> create reports

